			],
			"Message": "chore(Project): Sync Element submodule to latest\n\nUpdate Element submodule from 4f9670ef to 6f11cad3, bringing Debug Session Tracking, Custom Editor Save Events, Search Service Replacement, and UTF-8 truncation fixes:\n\n- Debug Session Tracking: Mountain implements DebugSessionEntry/DebugSessions map, spawns DAP adapters with stdin/stdout/stderr pipes, emits messages on sky://debug/dap-message\n- Custom Editor Save Events: Common adds CustomEditorSaved IPC event, Mountain implements OnSaveCustomDocument reverse-RPC to Cocoon\n- Search Service Replacement: ReplaceSearchService delegates to Mountain's search:findFiles/findInFiles handlers with .gitignore-aware WalkBuilder\n- UTF-8 Fix: char-aware truncation in WindServiceHandlers and OutputChannelAppend avoids panics on multi-byte codepoints\n\nAlso brings Common dependabot update to @cloudflare/workers-types and Cocoon submodule sync.",
			"SHA": "2c71fb8b3e9f6afccba0282d4d4a94b68645b1ad"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-27T20:18:50Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				102,
				1
			],
			"Message": "fix(Output): Add DI decorator metadata to ReplaceSearchService transform\n\nThe ReplaceSearchService transform was missing TypeScript-compiled decorator helpers (__decorate, __param) that VS Code's DI container requires to resolve constructor parameters by their @IService decorator types.\n\nWithout these, IInstantiationService bound parameters positionally with no type knowledge, causing all dependencies to arrive as undefined and crashing on this.uriIdentityService.extUri. This commit adds the __decorate/__param runtime helpers mirrored from VS Code's compiled output, enabling proper service resolution for IModelService, IEditorService, ITelemetryService, ILogService, IExtensionService, IFileService, IInstantiationService, and IUriIdentityService.\n\nThe search panel now properly delegates to Mountain's search:findFiles/search:findInFiles handlers via Tauri IPC.\n\nAlso syncs Common (dependabot update to @cloudflare/workers-types) and Cocoon submodules to latest Current.",
			"SHA": "5bdb16eb3f4ee41142dbd0925198efc21335df56"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-27T19:55:04Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				102,
				1
			],
			"Message": "feat(Project): Add debug session tracking, custom editor save events, and .gitignore-aware search\n\nSubmodule synchronization bringing three major features and bug fixes:\n\n1. Debug Session Tracking (Mountain + Common + Sky):\n   - Mountain implements DebugSessionEntry and DebugSessions map for lifecycle management\n   - StartDebugging spawns DAP adapters with stdin/stdout/stderr pipes and parses DAP frames\n   - Messages emitted on `sky://debug/dap-message` and forwarded to DOM events\n   - StopDebugging sends DAP disconnect and unregisters the session\n   - Common adds DebugDapMessage IPC event to support this flow\n\n2. Custom Editor Save Events (Common + Mountain + Sky):\n   - Common adds CustomEditorSaved IPC event for UI notifications\n   - Mountain implements OnSaveCustomDocument to reverse-RPC to Cocoon extension sidecar\n   - Sky adds handler for `sky://customEditor/saved` dispatching cel:customEditor:saved\n\n3. Search Service Replacement (Output + Mountain):\n   - Add ReplaceSearchService transform replacing web-worker RemoteSearchService\n   - Delegates to Mountain's `search:findFiles` / `search:findInFiles` handlers\n   - Makes search .gitignore-aware via Rust's ignore::WalkBuilder\n   - Fixes search panel showing 0 matches and node_modules appearing in results\n\n4. Bug Fixes (Mountain):\n   - Fix char-aware UTF-8 truncation in WindServiceHandlers and OutputChannelAppend\n   - Avoids panics when slicing multi-byte codepoints (e.g., `•` in SCM progress)\n\nImpact: Debugging now works with real DAP adapters, custom editor save callbacks notify observers, file search respects .gitignore rules, and UTF-8 truncation no longer panics on multi-byte characters.",
			"SHA": "84ac0fa57b583db758d41a5e7ce0a7cf8f468e21"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-27T15:56:18Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				102,
				1
			],
			"Message": "",
			"SHA": "4a3271f6b3b15fea442be66c85da072d4cf5e64c"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-27T14:49:32Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				102,
				1
			],
			"Message": "chore(Project): Sync Element submodule with event payload fixes and webview bridge\n\nSubmodule synchronization bringing critical fixes and a new feature:\n\n1. Mountain - Event Payload Alignment:\n   - Fix event channel names: terminal `opened`→`create`, `closed`→`exit`, debug `stop`→`sessionEnd`, statusbar `create`→`set-entry`, webview `message`→`post-message`, progress→`notification/progress-update`\n   - Correct payload keys to camelCase for OutputProvider, StatusBarProvider, TreeViewProvider, UserInterfaceProvider, Window\n   - Add parameter key fallback: probe camelCase first then snake_case for backward compat\n   - Fix SCM RootUri: reconstruct full URI from scheme/authority/path instead of relative URLs\n   - Add command registry emissions for Sky's workbench command palette\n\n2. Sky - New Webview Post-Message Bridge:\n   - Add handler for `sky://webview/post-message` to dispatch `cel:webview:post-message` events to renderer\n   - Bridges extension `postMessage` path from Cocoon with `{handle, message}` shape distinct from workbench-RPC `{panelId, method, params}`\n\n3. Dependencies:\n   - Cocoon, Echo, Rest: pozil/auto-assign-issue 2.2.0→3.0.0\n   - Echo: @cloudflare/workers-types, miniflare, wrangler updates\n\n4. Common: Document deprecated aliases UIShowInputBoxRequest and UIShowQuickPickRequest\n\nImpact: Terminal panes, tree views, status bar entries, and command palette entries now render correctly. Extensions can communicate back to Sky UI via the new webview post-message bridge.",
			"SHA": "ebf8546260e42a5029b846b7d74edb1ce8323180"
		}
	],
